"temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.23125534698742778, "compression_ratio": 1.7925311203319503, "no_speech_prob": 0.003676655935123563}, {"id": 34, "seek": 11704, "start": 137.76, "end": 142.82, "text": " And if Satan also is divided against himself, how will his kingdom stand?", "tokens": [51401, 400, 498, 16583, 611, 307, 6666, 1970, 3647, 11, 577, 486, 702, 10231, 1463, 30, 51654], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.23125534698742778, "compression_ratio": 1.7925311203319503, "no_speech_prob": 0.003676655935123563}, {"id": 35, "seek": 11704, "start": 143.3, "end": 146.28, "text": " For you say that I cast out demons by Beelzebul,", "tokens": [51678, 1171, 291, 584, 300, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 11, 51827], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.23125534698742778, "compression_ratio": 1.7925311203319503, "no_speech_prob": 0.003676655935123563}, {"id": 36, "seek": 11704, "start": 146.52, "end": 147.02, "text": " and I cast out demons by Beelzebul.", "tokens": [51839, 293, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.23125534698742778, "compression_ratio": 1.7925311203319503, "no_speech_prob": 0.003676655935123563}, {"id": 37, "seek": 14702, "start": 147.02, "end": 152.0, "text": " And if I cast out demons by Beelzebul, by whom do your sons cast them out?", "tokens": [50365, 400, 498, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 11, 538, 7101, 360, 428, 13476, 4193, 552, 484, 30, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 38, "seek": 14702, "start": 152.60000000000002, "end": 154.48000000000002, "text": " Therefore they will be your judges.", "tokens": [50644, 7504, 436, 486, 312, 428, 14449, 13, 50738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14702, "start": 155.22, "end": 158.66000000000003, "text": " But if it is by the finger of God that I cast out demons,", "tokens": [50775, 583, 498, 309, 307, 538, 264, 5984, 295, 1265, 300, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 11, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14702, "start": 159.28, "end": 161.70000000000002, "text": " then the kingdom of God has come upon you.", "tokens": [50978, 550, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 575, 808, 3564, 291, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14702, "start": 162.56, "end": 167.32000000000002, "text": " When a strong man, fully armed, guards his own palace, his goods are safe.", "tokens": [51142, 1133, 257, 2068, 587, 11, 4498, 16297, 11, 17652, 702, 1065, 15207, 11, 702, 10179, 366, 3273, 13, 51380], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14702, "start": 167.78, "end": 170.84, "text": " But when one stronger than he attacks him and overcomes him,", "tokens": [51403, 583, 562, 472, 7249, 813, 415, 8122, 796, 293, 670, 9055, 796, 11, 51556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14702, "start": 170.84, "end": 175.06, "text": " he takes away his armor in which he trusted and divides his spoil.", "tokens": [51556, 415, 2516, 1314, 702, 13124, 294, 597, 415, 16034, 293, 41347, 702, 18630, 13, 51767], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13023067775525546, "compression_ratio": 1.656, "no_speech_prob": 0.011157119646668434}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17506, "start": 175.06, "end": 181.56, "text": " Whoever is not with me is against me, and whoever does not gather with me scatters.", "tokens": [50365, 24743, 307, 406, 365, 385, 307, 1970, 385, 11, 293, 11387, 775, 406, 5448, 365, 385, 34951, 82, 13, 50690], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17506, "start": 182.52, "end": 185.64000000000001, "text": " When the unclean spirit has gone out of a person,", "tokens": [50738, 1133, 264, 9153, 282, 3797, 575, 2780, 484, 295, 257, 954, 11, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17506, "start": 186.06, "end": 191.1, "text": " it passes through waterless places seeking rest, and finding none, it says,", "tokens": [50915, 309, 11335, 807, 1281, 1832, 3190, 11670, 1472, 11, 293, 5006, 6022, 11, 309, 1619, 11, 51167], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17506, "start": 191.28, "end": 193.92000000000002, "text": " I will return to my house from which I came.", "tokens": [51176, 286, 486, 2736, 281, 452, 1782, 490, 597, 286, 1361, 13, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17506, "start": 194.28, "end": 197.58, "text": " And when it comes, it finds the house swept and put in order.", "tokens": [51326, 400, 562, 309, 1487, 11, 309, 10704, 264, 1782, 31791, 293, 829, 294, 1668, 13, 51491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17506, "start": 197.84, "end": 202.06, "text": " Then it goes and brings seven other spirits more evil than itself,", "tokens": [51504, 1396, 309, 1709, 293, 5607, 3407, 661, 16388, 544, 6724, 813, 2564, 11, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17506, "start": 202.34, "end": 204.02, "text": " and they enter and dwell there.", "tokens": [51729, 293, 436, 3242, 293, 24355, 456, 13, 51813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14722391880980326, "compression_ratio": 1.680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.00023050513118505478}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20402, "start": 204.02, "end": 208.04000000000002, "text": " And the last state of that person is worse than the first.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 264, 1036, 1785, 295, 300, 954, 307, 5324, 813, 264, 700, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09102271497249603, "compression_ratio": 0.9830508474576272, "no_speech_prob": 0.000720782030839473}, {"id": 52, "seek": 23402, "start": 234.02, "end": 237.9, "text": " But no sign will be given to it except the sign of Jonah.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 572, 1465, 486, 312, 2212, 281, 309, 3993, 264, 1465, 295, 42353, 13, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 53, "seek": 23402, "start": 238.60000000000002, "end": 241.56, "text": " For as Jonah became a sign to the people of Nineveh,", "tokens": [50594, 1171, 382, 42353, 3062, 257, 1465, 281, 264, 561, 295, 18939, 303, 71, 11, 50742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 54, "seek": 23402, "start": 242.12, "end": 245.46, "text": " so will the Son of Man be to this generation.", "tokens": [50770, 370, 486, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 312, 281, 341, 5125, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 55, "seek": 23402, "start": 246.60000000000002, "end": 251.18, "text": " The queen of the south will rise up at the judgment with the men of this generation", "tokens": [50994, 440, 12206, 295, 264, 7377, 486, 6272, 493, 412, 264, 12216, 365, 264, 1706, 295, 341, 5125, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 56, "seek": 23402, "start": 251.18, "end": 252.58, "text": " and condemn them.", "tokens": [51223, 293, 30733, 552, 13, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 57, "seek": 23402, "start": 252.92000000000002, "end": 256.90000000000003, "text": " For she came from the ends of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon.", "tokens": [51310, 1171, 750, 1361, 490, 264, 5314, 295, 264, 4120, 281, 1568, 264, 10712, 295, 32209, 13, 51509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 58, "seek": 23402, "start": 256.90000000000003, "end": 260.8, "text": " And behold, something greater than Solomon is here.", "tokens": [51509, 400, 27234, 11, 746, 5044, 813, 32209, 307, 510, 13, 51704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 59, "seek": 23402, "start": 261.62, "end": 263.90000000000003, "text": " The men of Nineveh will rise up at the judgment,", "tokens": [51745, 440, 1706, 295, 18939, 303, 71, 486, 6272, 493, 412, 264, 12216, 11, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18379961211105872, "compression_ratio": 1.8454935622317596, "no_speech_prob": 0.033581480383872986}, {"id": 60, "seek": 26402, "start": 264.02, "end": 266.47999999999996, "text": " with this generation, and condemn it.", "tokens": [50365, 365, 341, 5125, 11, 293, 30733, 309, 13, 50488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 61, "seek": 26402, "start": 266.79999999999995, "end": 269.02, "text": " For they repented at the preaching of Jonah.", "tokens": [50504, 1171, 436, 1085, 6003, 412, 264, 25381, 295, 42353, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 62, "seek": 26402, "start": 269.41999999999996, "end": 272.97999999999996, "text": " And behold, something greater than Jonah is here.", "tokens": [50635, 400, 27234, 11, 746, 5044, 813, 42353, 307, 510, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 63, "seek": 26402, "start": 274.06, "end": 278.38, "text": " No one after lighting a lamp puts it in a cellar or under a basket,", "tokens": [50867, 883, 472, 934, 9577, 257, 12684, 8137, 309, 294, 257, 2815, 289, 420, 833, 257, 8390, 11, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 64, "seek": 26402, "start": 278.74, "end": 282.06, "text": " but on a stand, so that those who enter may see the light.", "tokens": [51101, 457, 322, 257, 1463, 11, 370, 300, 729, 567, 3242, 815, 536, 264, 1442, 13, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 65, "seek": 26402, "start": 282.79999999999995, "end": 285.02, "text": " Your eye is the lamp of your body.", "tokens": [51304, 2260, 3313, 307, 264, 12684, 295, 428, 1772, 13, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 66, "seek": 26402, "start": 285.58, "end": 289.2, "text": " When your eye is healthy, your whole body is full of light.", "tokens": [51443, 1133, 428, 3313, 307, 4627, 11, 428, 1379, 1772, 307, 1577, 295, 1442, 13, 51624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 67, "seek": 26402, "start": 289.58, "end": 293.0, "text": " But when it is bad, your body is full of darkness.", "tokens": [51643, 583, 562, 309, 307, 1578, 11, 428, 1772, 307, 1577, 295, 11262, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 68, "seek": 26402, "start": 293.4, "end": 294.0, "text": " Then it will say,", "tokens": [51834, 1396, 309, 486, 584, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16675763090779958, "compression_ratio": 1.6852589641434264, "no_speech_prob": 0.007120975758880377}, {"id": 69, "seek": 29400, "start": 294.0, "end": 297.78, "text": " Therefore, be careful, lest the light in you be darkness.", "tokens": [50365, 7504, 11, 312, 5026, 11, 287, 377, 264, 1442, 294, 291, 312, 11262, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 70, "seek": 29400, "start": 298.72, "end": 303.18, "text": " If then, your whole body is full of light, having no part dark,", "tokens": [50601, 759, 550, 11, 428, 1379, 1772, 307, 1577, 295, 1442, 11, 1419, 572, 644, 2877, 11, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 71, "seek": 29400, "start": 303.54, "end": 307.76, "text": " it will be wholly bright, as when a lamp with its rays gives you light.", "tokens": [50842, 309, 486, 312, 45157, 4730, 11, 382, 562, 257, 12684, 365, 1080, 24417, 2709, 291, 1442, 13, 51053], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 72, "seek": 29400, "start": 309.6, "end": 313.62, "text": " While Jesus was speaking, a Pharisee asked him to dine with him,", "tokens": [51145, 3987, 2705, 390, 4124, 11, 257, 47742, 68, 2351, 796, 281, 274, 533, 365, 796, 11, 51346], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 73, "seek": 29400, "start": 313.94, "end": 315.82, "text": " so he went in and reclined at table.", "tokens": [51362, 370, 415, 1437, 294, 293, 850, 13564, 412, 3199, 13, 51456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 74, "seek": 29400, "start": 316.56, "end": 320.74, "text": " The Pharisee was astonished to see that he did not first wash before dinner.", "tokens": [51493, 440, 47742, 68, 390, 25687, 4729, 281, 536, 300, 415, 630, 406, 700, 5675, 949, 6148, 13, 51702], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 75, "seek": 29400, "start": 321.6, "end": 322.9, "text": " And the Lord said to him,", "tokens": [51745, 400, 264, 3257, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13649566616632242, "compression_ratio": 1.611336032388664, "no_speech_prob": 0.001056622713804245}, {"id": 76, "seek": 32290, "start": 322.9, "end": 327.14, "text": " Now you Pharisees, cleanse the outside of the cup and of the dish,", "tokens": [50365, 823, 291, 47742, 279, 11, 36085, 264, 2380, 295, 264, 4414, 293, 295, 264, 5025, 11, 50577], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 77, "seek": 32290, "start": 327.47999999999996, "end": 330.32, "text": " but inside you are full of greed and wickedness.", "tokens": [50594, 457, 1854, 291, 366, 1577, 295, 29230, 293, 22663, 1287, 13, 50736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 78, "seek": 32290, "start": 330.65999999999997, "end": 331.46, "text": " You fools!", "tokens": [50753, 509, 38625, 0, 50793], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 79, "seek": 32290, "start": 332.2, "end": 335.26, "text": " Did not he who made the outside make the inside also?", "tokens": [50830, 2589, 406, 415, 567, 1027, 264, 2380, 652, 264, 1854, 611, 30, 50983], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 80, "seek": 32290, "start": 335.88, "end": 338.73999999999995, "text": " But give his alms those things that are within,", "tokens": [51014, 583, 976, 702, 419, 2592, 729, 721, 300, 366, 1951, 11, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 81, "seek": 32290, "start": 339.2, "end": 342.06, "text": " and behold, everything is clean for you.", "tokens": [51180, 293, 27234, 11, 1203, 307, 2541, 337, 291, 13, 51323], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 82, "seek": 32290, "start": 343.2, "end": 345.35999999999996, "text": " But woe to you Pharisees!", "tokens": [51380, 583, 6020, 68, 281, 291, 47742, 279, 0, 51488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 83, "seek": 32290, "start": 345.78, "end": 348.35999999999996, "text": " For you tithe mint and rue and every herb,", "tokens": [51509, 1171, 291, 256, 45381, 18189, 293, 43919, 293, 633, 22662, 11, 51638], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 84, "seek": 32290, "start": 348.76, "end": 351.15999999999997, "text": " and neglect justice and the love of God.", "tokens": [51658, 293, 17745, 6118, 293, 264, 959, 295, 1265, 13, 51778], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 85, "seek": 32290, "start": 351.62, "end": 352.88, "text": " These you ought to have,", "tokens": [51801, 1981, 291, 13416, 281, 362, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22204717000325522, "compression_ratio": 1.6903765690376569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02555643394589424}, {"id": 86, "seek": 35290, "start": 352.9, "end": 355.08, "text": " without neglecting the others.", "tokens": [50365, 1553, 17745, 278, 264, 2357, 13, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 87, "seek": 35290, "start": 356.06, "end": 357.7, "text": " Woe to you Pharisees!", "tokens": [50523, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 47742, 279, 0, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 88, "seek": 35290, "start": 358.15999999999997, "end": 360.78, "text": " For you love the best seat in the synagogues,", "tokens": [50628, 1171, 291, 959, 264, 1151, 6121, 294, 264, 5451, 31599, 1247, 11, 50759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 89, "seek": 35290, "start": 360.96, "end": 362.71999999999997, "text": " and greetings in the marketplaces.", "tokens": [50768, 293, 33667, 294, 264, 2142, 34840, 13, 50856], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 90, "seek": 35290, "start": 363.64, "end": 364.64, "text": " Woe to you!", "tokens": [50902, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 0, 50952], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 91, "seek": 35290, "start": 365.09999999999997, "end": 367.12, "text": " For you are like unmarked graves,", "tokens": [50975, 1171, 291, 366, 411, 517, 5638, 292, 31664, 11, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 92, "seek": 35290, "start": 367.4, "end": 369.9, "text": " and people walk over them without knowing it.", "tokens": [51090, 293, 561, 1792, 670, 552, 1553, 5276, 309, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 93, "seek": 35290, "start": 370.64, "end": 372.03999999999996, "text": " One of the lawyers answered him,", "tokens": [51252, 1485, 295, 264, 16219, 10103, 796, 11, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 94, "seek": 35290, "start": 372.71999999999997, "end": 375.84, "text": " Teacher, in saying these things you insult us also.", "tokens": [51356, 19745, 11, 294, 1566, 613, 721, 291, 15285, 505, 611, 13, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 95, "seek": 35290, "start": 376.35999999999996, "end": 377.34, "text": " And he said,", "tokens": [51538, 400, 415, 848, 11, 51587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 96, "seek": 35290, "start": 378.09999999999997, "end": 380.12, "text": " Woe to you lawyers also!", "tokens": [51625, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 16219, 611, 0, 51726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 97, "seek": 35290, "start": 380.35999999999996, "end": 382.78, "text": " For you load people with burdens,", "tokens": [51738, 1171, 291, 3677, 561, 365, 37882, 11, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23594047283304148, "compression_ratio": 1.7285067873303168, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007378369336947799}, {"id": 98, "seek": 38290, "start": 382.9, "end": 383.76, "text": " hard to bear,", "tokens": [50365, 1152, 281, 6155, 11, 50408], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 99, "seek": 38290, "start": 384.2, "end": 386.2, "text": " and you yourselves do not touch the burdens", "tokens": [50430, 293, 291, 14791, 360, 406, 2557, 264, 37882, 50530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 100, "seek": 38290, "start": 386.2, "end": 387.7, "text": " with one of your fingers.", "tokens": [50530, 365, 472, 295, 428, 7350, 13, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 101, "seek": 38290, "start": 388.62, "end": 389.65999999999997, "text": " Woe to you!", "tokens": [50651, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 0, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 102, "seek": 38290, "start": 390.09999999999997, "end": 392.08, "text": " For you build the tombs of the prophets,", "tokens": [50725, 1171, 291, 1322, 264, 2916, 929, 295, 264, 27297, 11, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 103, "seek": 38290, "start": 392.4, "end": 393.71999999999997, "text": " whom your fathers killed.", "tokens": [50840, 7101, 428, 23450, 4652, 13, 50906], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 104, "seek": 38290, "start": 394.29999999999995, "end": 395.44, "text": " So you are witnesses,", "tokens": [50935, 407, 291, 366, 20217, 11, 50992], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 105, "seek": 38290, "start": 395.79999999999995, "end": 397.82, "text": " and you consent to the deeds of your fathers.", "tokens": [51010, 293, 291, 14546, 281, 264, 24539, 295, 428, 23450, 13, 51111], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 106, "seek": 38290, "start": 398.29999999999995, "end": 399.41999999999996, "text": " For they kill them,", "tokens": [51135, 1171, 436, 1961, 552, 11, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 107, "seek": 38290, "start": 399.76, "end": 401.46, "text": " and you build their tombs.", "tokens": [51208, 293, 291, 1322, 641, 2916, 929, 13, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 108, "seek": 38290, "start": 402.76, "end": 405.09999999999997, "text": " Therefore also the wisdom of God said,", "tokens": [51358, 7504, 611, 264, 10712, 295, 1265, 848, 11, 51475], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 109, "seek": 38290, "start": 405.52, "end": 407.79999999999995, "text": " I will send them prophets and apostles,", "tokens": [51496, 286, 486, 2845, 552, 27297, 293, 39397, 11, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 110, "seek": 38290, "start": 408.38, "end": 410.73999999999995, "text": " some of whom they will kill and persecute,", "tokens": [51639, 512, 295, 7101, 436, 486, 1961, 293, 23783, 1169, 11, 51757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 111, "seek": 38290, "start": 410.85999999999996, "end": 412.88, "text": " so that the blood of all the prophets,", "tokens": [51763, 370, 300, 264, 3390, 295, 439, 264, 27297, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2372010401053022, "compression_ratio": 1.8326359832635983, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035364911891520023}, {"id": 112, "seek": 41290, "start": 412.97999999999996, "end": 415.29999999999995, "text": " shed from the foundation of the world,", "tokens": [50369, 14951, 490, 264, 7030, 295, 264, 1002, 11, 50485], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 113, "seek": 41290, "start": 415.67999999999995, "end": 417.73999999999995, "text": " may be charged against this generation,", "tokens": [50504, 815, 312, 11109, 1970, 341, 5125, 11, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 114, "seek": 41290, "start": 418.4, "end": 421.2, "text": " from the blood of Abel to the blood of Zechariah,", "tokens": [50640, 490, 264, 3390, 295, 2847, 338, 281, 264, 3390, 295, 4853, 339, 3504, 545, 11, 50780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 115, "seek": 41290, "start": 421.38, "end": 423.76, "text": " who perished between the altar and the sanctuary.", "tokens": [50789, 567, 680, 4729, 1296, 264, 31435, 293, 264, 34390, 13, 50908], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 116, "seek": 41290, "start": 424.47999999999996, "end": 426.15999999999997, "text": " Yes, I tell you,", "tokens": [50944, 1079, 11, 286, 980, 291, 11, 51028], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 117, "seek": 41290, "start": 426.34, "end": 428.67999999999995, "text": " it will be required of this generation.", "tokens": [51037, 309, 486, 312, 4739, 295, 341, 5125, 13, 51154], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 118, "seek": 41290, "start": 430.0, "end": 431.5, "text": " Woe to you lawyers!", "tokens": [51220, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 16219, 0, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 119, "seek": 41290, "start": 432.2, "end": 434.34, "text": " For you have taken away the key of knowledge.", "tokens": [51330, 1171, 291, 362, 2726, 1314, 264, 2141, 295, 3601, 13, 51437], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 120, "seek": 41290, "start": 434.91999999999996, "end": 437.38, "text": " You did not enter yourselves,", "tokens": [51466, 509, 630, 406, 3242, 14791, 11, 51589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 121, "seek": 41290, "start": 437.84, "end": 440.15999999999997, "text": " and you hindered those who were entering.", "tokens": [51612, 293, 291, 20138, 4073, 729, 567, 645, 11104, 13, 51728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 122, "seek": 41290, "start": 440.59999999999997, "end": 442.12, "text": " As he went away from there,", "tokens": [51750, 1018, 415, 1437, 1314, 490, 456, 11, 51826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2723701411280139, "compression_ratio": 1.6778242677824269, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019115209579467773}, {"id": 123, "seek": 44212, "start": 442.12, "end": 445.26, "text": " the scribes and the Pharisees began to press him hard", "tokens": [50365, 264, 39435, 279, 293, 264, 47742, 279, 4283, 281, 1886, 796, 1152, 50522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14477446804875913, "compression_ratio": 1.3697478991596639, "no_speech_prob": 0.004535653628408909}, {"id": 124, "seek": 44212, "start": 445.26, "end": 447.72, "text": " and to provoke him to speak about many things,", "tokens": [50522, 293, 281, 47015, 796, 281, 1710, 466, 867, 721, 11, 50645], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14477446804875913, "compression_ratio": 1.3697478991596639, "no_speech_prob": 0.004535653628408909}, {"id": 125, "seek": 44212, "start": 448.28000000000003, "end": 449.28000000000003, "text": " lying in wait for him,", "tokens": [50673, 8493, 294, 1699, 337, 796, 11, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14477446804875913, "compression_ratio": 1.3697478991596639, "no_speech_prob": 0.004535653628408909}, {"id": 126, "seek": 44212, "start": 449.64, "end": 451.84000000000003, "text": " to catch him in something he might say.", "tokens": [50741, 281, 3745, 796, 294, 746, 415, 1062, 584, 13, 50851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14477446804875913, "compression_ratio": 1.3697478991596639, "no_speech_prob": 0.004535653628408909}], "language": "English"}